1
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:10,000
An infinite world, shaped as you explore.

2
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:16,000
Follow any trail. Climb any horizon.

3
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:24,000
Forests. Deserts. Mountains. Coasts.

4
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:29,000
The landscape is made to be crossed.

5
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:34,000
Wildlife roams, watches, and reacts.

6
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:41,000
Villages belong to the land around them.

7
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:48,000
People work, travel, trade, and gather.

8
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:56,000
Every character has needs, plans, and destinations.

9
00:00:56,000 --> 00:01:01,000
They remember what happened—and who was there.

10
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:11,000
In village markets, people meet, trade, and share the day.

11
00:01:11,000 --> 00:01:16,000
Step aboard. Walk the cars. Find a seat.

12
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:26,000
Above ground or below, another wonder is waiting.
